WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:06.266
Roxy gasped. A gorilla was kidnapping Metro City Rocket Dancers?

2
00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:10.576
Roxy looked at the dancer. "Where did the gorilla go?"

3
00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:14.848
The dancer pointed to a stairwell. "That way!"

4
00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:18.341
Zoom! Roxy shot up the stairwell.

5
00:00:18.342 --> 00:00:22.800
She threw open a door and flew onto the building’s roof.

6
00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:25.595
The roof was empty.

7
00:00:25.596 --> 00:00:28.601
"Help!" someone cried.

8
00:00:28.602 --> 00:00:33.594
"That must be Vera!" Roxy ran to the edge of the roof.

9
00:00:33.595 --> 00:00:37.027
The gorilla was climbing down the side of the building.

10
00:00:37.028 --> 00:00:39.749
It carried Vera under one arm.

11
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.716
The gorilla jumped down to the sidewalk and ran.

12
00:00:43.717 --> 00:00:49.573
Vera punched and kicked. "Let go of me, you big ape!"

13
00:00:49.574 --> 00:00:54.545
Roxy flew after the gorilla. "Stop right there!"

14
00:00:54.546 --> 00:01:00.020
The gorilla ignored her. It ran past a group of people.

15
00:01:00.021 --> 00:01:06.169
"Yikes!" a woman cried. "There’s a gorilla on the loose!"

16
00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:10.607
A man pointed. "It has one of the Rocket Dancers!"

17
00:01:10.608 --> 00:01:16.103
Roxy tried to grab the gorilla. It swatted her arm away.

18
00:01:16.104 --> 00:01:21.566
"Grr!" Roxy said. "I don’t want to hurt the gorilla.

19
00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:24.281
But I need to stop it!"

20
00:01:24.282 --> 00:01:27.063
Several police cars skidded to a stop.

21
00:01:27.064 --> 00:01:30.236
They blocked the sidewalk.

22
00:01:30.237 --> 00:01:32.701
Detective Smith jumped out of his car.

23
00:01:32.702 --> 00:01:38.665
"Stop right there, gorilla! And put down the Rocket Dancer!"

24
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:44.214
The gorilla charged into Detective Smith and knocked him over. "Oof!"

25
00:01:44.215 --> 00:01:49.310
Crunch! It jumped onto the detective’s car.

26
00:01:49.311 --> 00:01:54.402
Bam! The gorilla’s fist dented the roof.

27
00:01:54.403 --> 00:01:57.669
"Oh no!" Detective Smith said.

28
00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:00.545
The gorilla jumped down.

29
00:02:00.546 --> 00:02:04.677
It threw a trash can at Roxy. Whiz-hoo!

30
00:02:04.678 --> 00:02:07.809
She fired her eye laser beams.

31
00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:12.341
They accidentally hit Detective Smith’s car.

32
00:02:12.342 --> 00:02:17.913
Detective Smith groaned.

33
00:02:17.914 --> 00:02:20.928
The gorilla ran, knocking over a fruit stand.

34
00:02:20.929 --> 00:02:24.726
Fruit went everywhere. Apples rolled.

35
00:02:24.727 --> 00:02:29.390
Watermelons smashed. Bananas squished.

36
00:02:29.391 --> 00:02:36.808
The owner put her head in her hands. "All my fruit is ruined!"

37
00:02:36.809 --> 00:02:40.599
The gorilla dropped Vera and picked up a banana.

38
00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:45.020
Vera stood up and frowned. "Rotten gorilla!"

39
00:02:45.021 --> 00:02:49.385
Roxy hurried over. "Are you okay?"

40
00:02:49.386 --> 00:02:52.014
"I’m fine," Vera said.

41
00:02:52.015 --> 00:02:55.679
"But two other dancers are still missing.

42
00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:59.141
I’ll bet that gorilla kidnapped them."

43
00:02:59.142 --> 00:03:01.552
Roxy looked at the gorilla.

44
00:03:01.553 --> 00:03:04.583
The animal was happily eating bananas.

45
00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:07.426
Just then a van pulled up.

46
00:03:07.427 --> 00:03:10.335
A man got out and ran to the gorilla.

47
00:03:10.336 --> 00:03:13.754
"Harry! What are you doing? Where’s Rocket—Oh!"

48
00:03:13.755 --> 00:03:17.922
The man looked at Roxy. "You’re Rocket Girl!"

49
00:03:17.923 --> 00:03:20.272
He looked back at the gorilla.

50
00:03:20.273 --> 00:03:22.924
"Stop eating bananas, Harry!

51
00:03:22.925 --> 00:03:27.553
The real Rocket Girl is right there! Grab her!"

52
00:03:27.554 --> 00:03:30.087
Harry ate another banana.

53
00:03:30.088 --> 00:03:34.562
Roxy folded her arms. "Who are you?"

54
00:03:34.563 --> 00:03:36.650
The man didn't answer.

55
00:03:36.651 --> 00:03:41.922
He jumped into the van and drove off.

